{"logId": "75489c73-43cd-4845-976a-45139568b318", "result": {"layoutParsingResults": [{"prunedResult": {"page_count": null, "width": 1190, "height": 1684, "model_settings": {"use_doc_preprocessor": false, "use_layout_detection": true, "use_chart_recognition": false, "use_seal_recognition": false, "use_ocr_for_image_block": false, "format_block_content": false, "merge_layout_blocks": true, "markdown_ignore_labels": ["number", "footnote", "header", "header_image", "footer", "footer_image", "aside_text"], "return_layout_polygon_points": true}, "parsing_res_list": [{"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "一、安全", "block_bbox": [108, 167, 206, 193], "block_id": 0, "block_order": 1, "group_id": 0, "block_polygon_points": [[108.0, 167.0], [206.0, 167.0], [206.0, 193.0], [108.0, 193.0]]}, {"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "员工上下班安全规定", "block_bbox": [109, 196, 295, 221], "block_id": 1, "block_order": 2, "group_id": 1, "block_polygon_points": [[109.0, 196.0], [295.0, 196.0], [295.0, 221.0], [109.0, 221.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "1、严禁酒后驾车、无证驾驶、将车交无证人员驾驶；", "block_bbox": [107, 225, 524, 249], "block_id": 2, "block_order": 3, "group_id": 2, "block_polygon_points": [[107.0, 225.0], [524.0, 225.0], [524.0, 249.0], [107.0, 249.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "2、不准闯红灯、逆向行驶、超速行驶；", "block_bbox": [108, 250, 420, 272], "block_id": 3, "block_order": 4, "group_id": 3, "block_polygon_points": [[108.0, 250.0], [420.0, 250.0], [420.0, 272.0], [108.0, 272.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "3、驾驶车辆时需系安全带，不允许穿拖鞋、高跟鞋，不允许吸烟，不允许接打电话；", "block_bbox": [106, 275, 769, 299], "block_id": 4, "block_order": 5, "group_id": 4, "block_polygon_points": [[106.0, 275.0], [769.0, 275.0], [769.0, 299.0], [106.0, 299.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "4、骑助力车、电动车、自行车不准进入机动车道，行人不允许横跨交通护栏，要走人行横道、斑马线；", "block_bbox": [106, 301, 792, 348], "block_id": 5, "block_order": 6, "group_id": 5, "block_polygon_points": [[106.0, 301.0], [792.0, 301.0], [792.0, 348.0], [106.0, 348.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "5、驾驶摩托车、踏板电动车上下班，必须正确戴好安全头盔以及安全反光带；", "block_bbox": [107, 351, 717, 374], "block_id": 6, "block_order": 7, "group_id": 6, "block_polygon_points": [[107.0, 351.0], [717.0, 351.0], [717.0, 374.0], [107.0, 374.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "6、上道路行驶前，应当对汽车、摩托车、电动车的安全技术性能进行认真检查；不要驾驶安全设施不全等具有安全隐患的汽车、摩托车、电动车；", "block_bbox": [106, 377, 792, 424], "block_id": 7, "block_order": 8, "group_id": 7, "block_polygon_points": [[106.0, 377.0], [792.0, 377.0], [792.0, 424.0], [106.0, 424.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "7、按规定停放车辆，离开车辆时应对车辆采取制动措施，并确认安全，以防发生意外事故；", "block_bbox": [107, 427, 791, 474], "block_id": 8, "block_order": 9, "group_id": 8, "block_polygon_points": [[107.0, 427.0], [791.0, 427.0], [791.0, 474.0], [107.0, 474.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "8、机动车发生故障及事故时，应开启双闪灯，并将机动车移至不妨碍交通的地方停放，难以移动的应持续开启双闪灯，并在来车方向设置警告标志等措施，扩大示警距离，必要时迅速报警并上报主管，人员撤离到安全地带（报警要讲清事故发生的时间、地点、主要情况和造成的后果）；", "block_bbox": [106, 477, 786, 576], "block_id": 9, "block_order": 10, "group_id": 9, "block_polygon_points": [[106.0, 477.0], [786.0, 477.0], [786.0, 576.0], [106.0, 576.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "9、因公出差人员或外派（驻外）人员，身处异地，更要加强自我保护、自我防范意识，避免意外交通事故和人身伤害事故发生。", "block_bbox": [105, 579, 787, 628], "block_id": 10, "block_order": 11, "group_id": 10, "block_polygon_points": [[105.0, 579.0], [787.0, 579.0], [787.0, 628.0], [105.0, 628.0]]}, {"block_label": "image", "block_content": "", "block_bbox": [814, 296, 1118, 535], "block_id": 11, "block_order": null, "group_id": 11, "block_polygon_points": [[814.0, 296.0], [1118.0, 296.0], [1118.0, 535.0], [814.0, 535.0]]}, {"block_label": "image", "block_content": "", "block_bbox": [940, 595, 1122, 641], "block_id": 12, "block_order": null, "group_id": 12, "block_polygon_points": [[940.0, 595.0], [1122.0, 595.0], [1122.0, 641.0], [940.0, 641.0]]}, {"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "工作篇--抢劫事件", "block_bbox": [95, 678, 309, 712], "block_id": 13, "block_order": 12, "group_id": 13, "block_polygon_points": [[95.0, 678.0], [309.0, 678.0], [309.0, 712.0], [95.0, 712.0]]}, {"block_label": "image", "block_content": "", "block_bbox": [89, 738, 1128, 825], "block_id": 14, "block_order": null, "group_id": 14, "block_polygon_points": [[89.0, 738.0], [1128.0, 738.0], [1128.0, 825.0], [89.0, 825.0]]}, {"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "三、盗窃事件", "block_bbox": [158, 830, 299, 858], "block_id": 15, "block_order": 13, "group_id": 15, "block_polygon_points": [[158.0, 830.0], [299.0, 830.0], [299.0, 858.0], [158.0, 858.0]]}, {"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "案例：", "block_bbox": [159, 867, 219, 891], "block_id": 16, "block_order": 14, "group_id": 16, "block_polygon_points": [[159.0, 867.0], [218.0, 867.0], [218.0, 890.0], [159.0, 890.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "1、三楼一员工丢失刚发完的工资3000元左右；", "block_bbox": [159, 895, 494, 947], "block_id": 17, "block_order": 15, "group_id": 17, "block_polygon_points": [[159.0, 895.0], [494.0, 895.0], [494.0, 947.0], [159.0, 947.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "2、二楼一员工丢失手机一部：", "block_bbox": [158, 950, 422, 976], "block_id": 18, "block_order": 16, "group_id": 18, "block_polygon_points": [[158.0, 950.0], [422.0, 950.0], [422.0, 976.0], [158.0, 976.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "3、超市一员工丢失手机一部：", "block_bbox": [158, 979, 422, 1003], "block_id": 19, "block_order": 17, "group_id": 19, "block_polygon_points": [[158.0, 979.0], [422.0, 979.0], [422.0, 1003.0], [158.0, 1003.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "4、四楼一员工丢失手机一部：", "block_bbox": [158, 1006, 421, 1031], "block_id": 20, "block_order": 18, "group_id": 20, "block_polygon_points": [[158.0, 1006.0], [421.0, 1006.0], [421.0, 1031.0], [158.0, 1031.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "5、五楼电影丢失手机、现金；", "block_bbox": [159, 1035, 422, 1059], "block_id": 21, "block_order": 19, "group_id": 21, "block_polygon_points": [[159.0, 1035.0], [422.0, 1035.0], [422.0, 1059.0], [159.0, 1059.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "6、三楼一员工多次丢失现金800元左右", "block_bbox": [158, 1062, 502, 1087], "block_id": 22, "block_order": 20, "group_id": 22, "block_polygon_points": [[158.0, 1062.0], [502.0, 1062.0], [502.0, 1087.0], [158.0, 1087.0]]}, {"block_label": "image", "block_content": "", "block_bbox": [151, 1090, 437, 1294], "block_id": 23, "block_order": null, "group_id": 23, "block_polygon_points": [[151.0, 1090.0], [437.0, 1090.0], [437.0, 1294.0], [151.0, 1294.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "处理方法：", "block_bbox": [622, 848, 713, 870], "block_id": 24, "block_order": 21, "group_id": 24, "block_polygon_points": [[622.0, 848.0], [712.0, 848.0], [712.0, 869.0], [622.0, 869.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "①上班不要随身携带过多的现金；", "block_bbox": [622, 869, 887, 891], "block_id": 25, "block_order": 22, "group_id": 25, "block_polygon_points": [[622.0, 869.0], [887.0, 869.0], [887.0, 891.0], [622.0, 891.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "②手机、钱包等贵重物品不要随意摆放；（如：仓库、柜台抽屉等）", "block_bbox": [622, 891, 993, 932], "block_id": 26, "block_order": 23, "group_id": 26, "block_polygon_points": [[622.0, 891.0], [993.0, 891.0], [993.0, 932.0], [622.0, 932.0]]}, {"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "工作篇--盗窃事件", "block_bbox": [95, 1352, 309, 1385], "block_id": 27, "block_order": 24, "group_id": 27, "block_polygon_points": [[95.0, 1352.0], [309.0, 1352.0], [309.0, 1385.0], [95.0, 1385.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "③发完工资要及时存进银行，不要遗留在卖场；", "block_bbox": [622, 933, 995, 954], "block_id": 28, "block_order": 25, "group_id": 28, "block_polygon_points": [[622.0, 933.0], [994.0, 933.0], [994.0, 953.0], [622.0, 953.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "④进出仓库及时上锁，特别是试衣间和仓库相连的；", "block_bbox": [622, 955, 998, 995], "block_id": 29, "block_order": 26, "group_id": 29, "block_polygon_points": [[622.0, 955.0], [998.0, 955.0], [998.0, 995.0], [622.0, 995.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "⑤丢失后不要过多的声张，也不要自作主张去怀疑指责别人；", "block_bbox": [623, 997, 998, 1039], "block_id": 30, "block_order": 27, "group_id": 30, "block_polygon_points": [[623.0, 997.0], [998.0, 997.0], [998.0, 1039.0], [623.0, 1039.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "⑥及时通知主管及保安。", "block_bbox": [624, 1039, 812, 1061], "block_id": 31, "block_order": 28, "group_id": 31, "block_polygon_points": [[624.0, 1039.0], [811.0, 1039.0], [811.0, 1060.0], [624.0, 1060.0]]}, {"block_label": "image", "block_content": "", "block_bbox": [624, 1075, 912, 1290], "block_id": 32, "block_order": null, "group_id": 32, "block_polygon_points": [[624.0, 1075.0], [912.0, 1075.0], [912.0, 1290.0], [624.0, 1290.0]]}, {"block_label": "footer_image", "block_content": "", "block_bbox": [940, 1272, 1123, 1314], "block_id": 33, "block_order": null, "group_id": 33, "block_polygon_points": [[940.0, 1272.0], [1123.0, 1272.0], [1123.0, 1314.0], [940.0, 1314.0]]}], "layout_det_res": {"boxes": [{"cls_id": 17, "label": "paragraph_title", "score": 0.8162206411361694, "coordinate": [108, 167, 206, 193], "order": 1, "polygon_points": [[108.0, 167.0], [206.0, 167.0], [206.0, 193.0], [108.0, 193.0]]}, {"cls_id": 17, "label": "paragraph_title", "score": 0.8472697138786316, "coordinate": [109, 196, 295, 221], "order": 2, "polygon_points": [[109.0, 196.0], [295.0, 196.0], [295.0, 221.0], [109.0, 221.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.798855721950531, "coordinate": [107, 225, 524, 249], "order": 3, "polygon_points": [[107.0, 225.0], [524.0, 225.0], [524.0, 249.0], [107.0, 249.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.8152478933334351, "coordinate": [108, 250, 420, 272], "order": 4, "polygon_points": [[108.0, 250.0], [420.0, 250.0], [420.0, 272.0], [108.0, 272.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.8335620164871216, "coordinate": [106, 275, 769, 299], "order": 5, "polygon_points": [[106.0, 275.0], [769.0, 275.0], [769.0, 299.0], [106.0, 299.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.8768177032470703, "coordinate": [106, 301, 792, 348], "order": 6, "polygon_points": [[106.0, 301.0], [792.0, 301.0], [792.0, 348.0], [106.0, 348.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.8279995322227478, "coordinate": [107, 351, 717, 374], "order": 7, "polygon_points": [[107.0, 351.0], [717.0, 351.0], [717.0, 374.0], [107.0, 374.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.9036628007888794, "coordinate": [106, 377, 792, 424], "order": 8, "polygon_points": [[106.0, 377.0], [792.0, 377.0], [792.0, 424.0], [106.0, 424.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.8959046602249146, "coordinate": [107, 427, 791, 474], "order": 9, "polygon_points": [[107.0, 427.0], [791.0, 427.0], [791.0, 474.0], [107.0, 474.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.9447832107543945, "coordinate": [106, 477, 786, 576], "order": 10, "polygon_points": [[106.0, 477.0], [786.0, 477.0], [786.0, 576.0], [106.0, 576.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.8971784114837646, "coordinate": [105, 579, 787, 628], "order": 11, "polygon_points": [[105.0, 579.0], [787.0, 579.0], [787.0, 628.0], [105.0, 628.0]]}, {"cls_id": 14, "label": "image", "score": 0.9250418543815613, "coordinate": [814, 296, 1118, 535], "order": null, "polygon_points": [[814.0, 296.0], [1118.0, 296.0], [1118.0, 535.0], [814.0, 535.0]]}, {"cls_id": 14, "label": "image", "score": 0.354660302400589, "coordinate": [940, 595, 1122, 641], "order": null, "polygon_points": [[940.0, 595.0], [1122.0, 595.0], [1122.0, 641.0], [940.0, 641.0]]}, {"cls_id": 17, "label": "paragraph_title", "score": 0.8901030421257019, "coordinate": [95, 678, 309, 712], "order": 12, "polygon_points": [[95.0, 678.0], [309.0, 678.0], [309.0, 712.0], [95.0, 712.0]]}, {"cls_id": 14, "label": "image", "score": 0.6039811968803406, "coordinate": [89, 738, 1128, 825], "order": null, "polygon_points": [[89.0, 738.0], [1128.0, 738.0], [1128.0, 825.0], [89.0, 825.0]]}, {"cls_id": 17, "label